  "scope": "Retained syntax/origin representation and ordinary parser/body-index/thunk component. Source publication, currentness integration, VM execution and all eight macro-specific shortcut removals remain outstanding.",
  "implemented": [
    "Immutable opaque syntax snapshot retains exact used source-span records and full context ancestry, including actual caller semicolons",
    "Ordinary ParsedFile replays pinned syntax events directly, preserving expansion grouping without reparsing display text or adding synthetic scopes",
    "Ordinary outline, body index and nested item/container verification share structural body identity for retained syntax and preserve exact UTF-8 byte identity for original sources",
    "Retained body identity includes pinned node/token shape, text and owning edition runs; unrelated cold body edits and absolute offset shifts preserve the unchanged body key",
    "Ordinary initial thunk/verifier probes inspect expanded nodes without opaque macro scalar slots or phases",
    "Seven existing small compile-time source/graph fixture inputs moved unchanged from ignored historical artifacts into tracked fixtures, with only include_str path redirects and provenance"
  ],
